<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez W.I. Carr sets Wharf warrants.</title>
<headline>Indosuez W.I. Carr sets Wharf warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Friday it intended to launch 100 million American-style call warrants on shares of Wharf (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$39.375    PREMIUM	 18.58 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.50925   GEARING	 7.4x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  19.DEC.97    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    LISTING DATE  15.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
